          <FaqItem question="What happens if I forget my master password?" answer="Your master password is the only key to your vault. We cannot reset it and cannot recover your data without it. Write it down. Store it somewhere safe. Export your vault regularly as a backup." delay={1} />
          <FaqItem question="Can Ironlox see any of my data?" answer="No. Your vault is encrypted on your device with your master password. We receive only an encrypted blob. Even with full database access, your data is mathematically unreadable without your password." delay={2} />
          <FaqItem question="Is Ironlox really open source?" answer="Yes. Every line of code &mdash; the client apps, the encryption library, the server &mdash; is public on GitHub. You can read it, audit it, and build it yourself. Trust through transparency." delay={3} />
          <FaqItem question="How do I switch from another password manager?" answer="Export your data from your current manager as CSV, then import into Ironlox. We support formats from 1Password, Bitwarden, LastPass, Dashlane, and others. The import takes under a minute." delay={4} />
          <FaqItem question="Does Ironlox work offline?" answer="Yes. Your vault is cached locally on each device. You can access, edit, and use your passwords offline. Changes sync automatically when you reconnect." delay={5} />
          <FaqItem question="How do you make money if the free tier is so generous?" answer="We charge for Premium features ($3/mo). We never sell your data, show ads, or track you. Our business model is simple: you pay for extra features, and we keep your data private. Always." delay={6} />
